批量精确 ID 解锁 / Batched exact-ID unlock

与 explicit-empty-proxy.patch 一起应用，保留原并发路径锁功能。
Apply together with explicit-empty-proxy.patch; preserves the original concurrent path-lock commands.
Source: https://github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs.git
Base: 35ec69f0e544a91a266ebe92ac4cf2198f61cbcd
Toolchain: Go 1.19.13, CGO_ENABLED=0

  git apply --unidiff-zero <explicit-empty-proxy.patch>
  git apply --unidiff-zero <this-patch>
  go test ./locking ./lfshttp -run 'Unlock|Proxy' -count=1
  go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w -X github.com/git-lfs/git-lfs/v3/config.GitCommit=35ec69f0+proxy-idbatch-unlock1" -o <output> .
  python <plugin>/Resources/GitLfsPatches/test_batch_cli.py <built-git-lfs-executable>

本次将代理与批量 ID 两个补丁构建进全部四个平台工具；Win64 执行回归测试，其余仅交叉编译。
Both patches are built into all four bundled tools; Win64 is runtime-tested, others are cross-compiled only.
GOOS/GOARCH -> output:
  windows/amd64 -> git-lfs.exe
  linux/amd64 -> git-lfs
  darwin/amd64 -> git-lfs-mac-amd64
  darwin/arm64 -> git-lfs-mac-arm64

主动解锁保留工作区与暂存内容，不以本地修改阻止释放本人锁；--force 仍表示打破他人锁，插件不会使用它。
Explicit unlock preserves worktree and index edits. --force retains its separate foreign-lock meaning and is never passed by the plugin.

